From 712413d25f91716e7aaf8cc5f402de8ffe908b03 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 14:18:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Fix mobile Day Close swipe and Add Doctor Save button

Root cause for Day Close: ModuleErrorBoundary used overflow-x-hidden on
every route, so wide tables were clipped and could not scroll sideways
even when a page wrapped them in overflow-x-auto.

- ModuleErrorBoundary: overflow-x-auto + min-w-0
- Dialog/AlertDialog: max-h 90dvh + overflow-y-auto so Add Doctor Save
  is reachable on mobile
- DayClose/Staff/Accounting/BillDetail/PatientDetail/OrderDetail:
  constrained horizontal scroll wrappers with touch-pan-x
---
